# Copyright (c) 2026 The wtfbsd contributors. BSD-2-Clause (see LICENSE).
#
# Empty by design: overlay/base already installs the essentials (the
# pkg_add tool, the trust store, bash). Add one package name per line to
# grow the appliance, e.g.:
#   htop
#   tmux
#
# The ZFS data pool needs no package: zpool(8) and zfs(8) are part of the
# NetBSD base.
